{"game":"DOOM 1993","source":"core","apworld":null,"world_version":null,"groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99}},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full"},{"key":"goal","name":"Goal","kind":"choice","doc":"Choose the main goal.\ncomplete_all_levels: All levels of the selected episodes\ncomplete_boss_levels: Boss levels (E#M8) of selected episodes","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"complete_all_levels","label":"Complete All Levels","id":0},{"value":"complete_boss_levels","label":"Complete Boss Levels","id":1}],"aliases":{},"default":"complete_all_levels"},{"key":"difficulty","name":"Difficulty","kind":"choice","doc":"Choose the game difficulty. These options match DOOM's skill levels.\nbaby (I'm too young to die.) Same as easy, with double ammo pickups and half damage taken.\neasy (Hey, not too rough.) Less monsters or strength.\nmedium (Hurt me plenty.) Default.\nhard (Ultra-Violence.) More monsters or strength.\nnightmare (Nightmare!) Monsters attack more rapidly and respawn.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"baby","label":"Baby","id":0},{"value":"easy","label":"Easy","id":1},{"value":"medium","label":"Medium","id":2},{"value":"hard","label":"Hard","id":3},{"value":"nightmare","label":"Nightmare","id":4}],"aliases":{"hmp":"medium","hntr":"easy","itytd":"baby","nm":"nightmare","uv":"hard"},"default":"medium"},{"key":"random_monsters","name":"Random Monsters","kind":"choice","doc":"Choose how monsters are randomized.\nvanilla: No randomization\nshuffle: Monsters are shuffled within the level\nrandom_balanced: Monsters are completely randomized, but balanced based on existing ratio in the level. (Small monsters vs medium vs big)\nrandom_chaotic: Monsters are completely randomized, but balanced based on existing ratio in the entire game.    ","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"vanilla","label":"Vanilla","id":0},{"value":"shuffle","label":"Shuffle","id":1},{"value":"random_balanced","label":"Random Balanced","id":2},{"value":"random_chaotic","label":"Random Chaotic","id":3}],"aliases":{},"default":"shuffle"},{"key":"random_pickups","name":"Random Pickups","kind":"choice","doc":"Choose how pickups are randomized.\nvanilla: No randomization\nshuffle: Pickups are shuffled within the level\nrandom_balanced: Pickups are completely randomized, but balanced based on existing ratio in the level. (Small pickups vs Big)","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"vanilla","label":"Vanilla","id":0},{"value":"shuffle","label":"Shuffle","id":1},{"value":"random_balanced","label":"Random Balanced","id":2}],"aliases":{},"default":"shuffle"},{"key":"random_music","name":"Random Music","kind":"choice","doc":"Level musics will be randomized.\nvanilla: No randomization\nshuffle_selected: Selected episodes' levels will be shuffled\nshuffle_game: All the music will be shuffled","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"vanilla","label":"Vanilla","id":0},{"value":"shuffle_selected","label":"Shuffle Selected","id":1},{"value":"shuffle_game","label":"Shuffle Game","id":2}],"aliases":{},"default":"vanilla"},{"key":"flip_levels","name":"Flip Levels","kind":"choice","doc":"Flip levels on one axis.\nvanilla: No flipping\nflipped: All levels are flipped\nrandomly_flipped: Random levels are flipped","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"vanilla","label":"Vanilla","id":0},{"value":"flipped","label":"Flipped","id":1},{"value":"randomly_flipped","label":"Randomly Flipped","id":2}],"aliases":{},"default":"vanilla"},{"key":"allow_death_logic","name":"Allow Death Logic","kind":"toggle","doc":"Some locations require a timed puzzle that can only be tried once.\nAfter which, if the player failed to get it, the location cannot be checked anymore.\nBy default, no progression items are placed here. There is a way, hovewer, to still get them:\nGet killed in the current map. The map will reset, you can now attempt the puzzle again.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"pro","name":"Pro Doom","kind":"toggle","doc":"Include difficult tricks into rules. Mostly employed by speed runners.\ni.e.: Leaps across to a locked area, trigger a switch behind a window at the right angle, etc.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"start_with_computer_area_maps","name":"Start With Computer Area Maps","kind":"toggle","doc":"Give the player all Computer Area Map items from the start.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"death_link","name":"Death Link","kind":"toggle","doc":"When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.</p>\n","default":"false"},{"key":"reset_level_on_death","name":"Reset Level on Death","kind":"toggle","doc":"When dying, levels are reset and monsters respawned. But inventory and checks are kept.\nTurning this setting off is considered easy mode. Good for new players that don't know the levels well.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true"},{"key":"episode1","name":"Episode 1","kind":"toggle","doc":"Knee-Deep in the Dead.\nIf none of the episodes are chosen, Episode 1 will be chosen by default.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true"},{"key":"episode2","name":"Episode 2","kind":"toggle","doc":"The Shores of Hell.\nIf none of the episodes are chosen, Episode 1 will be chosen by default.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true"},{"key":"episode3","name":"Episode 3","kind":"toggle","doc":"Inferno.\nIf none of the episodes are chosen, Episode 1 will be chosen by default.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true"},{"key":"episode4","name":"Episode 4","kind":"toggle","doc":"Thy Flesh Consumed.\nIf none of the episodes are chosen, Episode 1 will be chosen by default.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"split_backpack","name":"Split Backpack","kind":"toggle","doc":"Split the Backpack into four individual items, each one increasing ammo capacity for one type of weapon only.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"backpack_count","name":"Backpack Count","kind":"range","doc":"How many Backpacks will be available.\nIf Split Backpack is set, this will be the number of each capacity upgrade available.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":10,"default":1},{"key":"max_ammo_bullets","name":"Max Ammo - Bullets","kind":"range","doc":"Set the starting ammo capacity for bullets.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":200,"max":999,"default":200},{"key":"max_ammo_shells","name":"Max Ammo - Shells","kind":"range"